msgstr "**Verify**"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:13
msgid "`tazuna.yaml` が壊れていないことの保証"
msgstr "Guarantee that `tazuna.yaml` is not broken"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:13
