msgstr "`plan` only (read-only)"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:14
msgid "**反映**"
msgstr "**Apply**"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:14
msgid "`main` の内容をクラスタに反映する"
msgstr "Reflect the contents of `main` into the cluster"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:14
