msgstr "tazuna plan -f tazuna.yaml > plan.txt"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:45
msgid "post plan to PR"
msgstr "post plan to PR"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:51
msgid ""
"`tazuna plan` は読み取り専用なので、PR の権限境界に乗せやすいのが利点です。"
msgstr ""
"Because `tazuna plan` is read-only, its advantage is that it fits easily "
"within a PR's permission boundary."

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:53
