"# クラスタ側の都合に応じて、aws-iam-authenticator / gke-gcloud-auth-plugin\n"
"          # / kubeconfig secret 等で current-context を設定する\n"
msgstr ""
"# Set current-context using aws-iam-authenticator / gke-gcloud-auth-plugin\n"
"          # / kubeconfig secret etc., depending on cluster-side specifics\n"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:85
msgid ""
"`tazuna apply` の current-context は kubeconfig の current-context そのもので"
"す。 CI で current-context を切り替えるステップを必ず明示します。"
msgstr ""
"The current-context for `tazuna apply` is exactly the kubeconfig current-"
"context. In CI, always explicitly include a step that sets the current-"
"context."

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:87
msgid ""
"`tazuna.yaml` に [`spec.context_matches`](../reference/tazuna-"
"yaml.md#context_matches) を 入れておけば、誤って違うクラスタを向いた "
"kubeconfig で apply しようとしても 即終了します。CI でも有効な保険になりま"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"Including [`spec.context_matches`](../reference/tazuna-"
"yaml.md#context_matches) in `tazuna.yaml` makes the system fail fast if it "
"would `apply` against a kubeconfig pointing to the wrong cluster. It is a "
"useful safety net in CI as well."

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:90
msgid ""
"Tazuna は失敗時に非ゼロ終了するので、CI 側で特別なエラーハンドリングは不要で"
"す （[CLI - 終了コード](../reference/cli/index.md#終了コード)）。"
msgstr ""
"Tazuna exits non-zero on failure, so no special error handling is needed on "
"the CI side (see [CLI - Exit Codes](../reference/cli/index.md#終了コード))."

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:93
msgid "`apply` の動作モード"
msgstr "`apply` operating modes"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:95
msgid ""
"`tazuna apply` には 3 つの動作モードがあります（詳細は [`tazuna apply`](../"
"reference/cli/apply.md#state-連携---sync----prune----atomic) を参照）。"
msgstr ""
"`tazuna apply` has three operating modes (see [`tazuna apply`](../reference/"
"cli/apply.md#state-連携---sync----prune----atomic) for details)."

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:98
msgid "モード"
msgstr "Mode"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:98
msgid "いつ何が走るか"
msgstr "When what runs"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:98
