"トです。 組み込みの `default-op`（1Password）以外を使う、または provider を複"
"数並べて使い分けたい ときに書きます。"
msgstr ""
"`spec.providers[]` is the list of Secret provider declarations referenced by "
"GenesisSecret. Write it when you use something other than the built-in "
"`default-op` (1Password), or when you want to line up multiple providers and "
"select between them."

