msgstr "./genesissecrets/aws.yaml"

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:20
msgid ""
"`type: genesissecret` の `path` は **YAML ファイル 1 つを直接指します** （他"
"の Manifest type のようにディレクトリを指すのではありません）。"
msgstr ""
"The `path` for `type: genesissecret` **points directly to a single YAML "
"file** (unlike other Manifest types that point to a directory)."

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:23
msgid "ルート (`GenesisSecret`)"
msgstr "Root (`GenesisSecret`)"

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:29
msgid "[GenesisSecretSpec](#genesissecretspec)"
msgstr "[GenesisSecretSpec](#genesissecretspec)"

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:29
msgid "GenesisSecret 本体。"
msgstr "The GenesisSecret body."

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:31
msgid ""
"`apiVersion` / `kind` のフィールドは構造体に対応する宣言がなく、書いても 読ま"
"れずに無視されますが、慣習として `apiVersion: tazuna.pepabo.com/v1` / `kind: "
"GenesisSecret` を書いておくと、後から検証が入っても揃えやすくなります。"
msgstr ""
"There is no struct field corresponding to `apiVersion` / `kind`; writing "
"them is ignored without being read. By convention, writing `apiVersion: "
"tazuna.pepabo.com/v1` / `kind: GenesisSecret` makes it easier to align if "
"validation is added later."

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:35
msgid "GenesisSecretSpec"
msgstr "GenesisSecretSpec"

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:39
msgid "`provider`"
msgstr "`provider`"

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:39
msgid ""
"取得元 Provider の名前。`tazuna.yaml` の [`spec.providers[]`](./tazuna-"
"yaml.md#providers) に宣言された `name` のいずれか、または組み込みの `default-"
"op` を指定します。空文字のときは後方互換のため `default-op` にフォールバック"
"します。詳細は [Secret provider](./secret-providers.md) を参照してください。"
msgstr ""
"The name of the source Provider. Specify one of the `name`s declared in "
"`tazuna.yaml`'s [`spec.providers[]`](./tazuna-yaml.md#providers), or the "
"built-in `default-op`. When empty, it falls back to `default-op` for "
"backward compatibility. See [Secret provider](./secret-providers.md) for "
"details."

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:40
msgid "`secrets`"
msgstr "`secrets`"

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:40
msgid "\\[[GenesisSecretGenerate](#genesissecretgenerate)\\]"
msgstr "\\[[GenesisSecretGenerate](#genesissecretgenerate)\\]"

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:40
msgid "取得対象。複数書けます。"
msgstr "Retrieval targets. Multiple may be written."

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:41
msgid "`outputs`"
msgstr "`outputs`"

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:41
msgid "\\[[GenesisSecretOutput](#genesissecretoutput)\\]"
msgstr "\\[[GenesisSecretOutput](#genesissecretoutput)\\]"

#: src/reference/genesis-secret.md:41
msgid "出力先。複数書けます。"
msgstr "Output destinations. Multiple may be written."

