"`type` と整合しない config（`type: onepassword` に `envfile:` が付いている"
"等）が無いこと"
msgstr ""
"There must be no config inconsistent with `type` (such as `envfile:` "
"attached to `type: onepassword`)."

#: src/reference/secret-providers.md:143
msgid "`type: envfile` のときは `envfile.path` が必須"
msgstr "`envfile.path` is required when `type: envfile`."

