msgstr "Take SHA-256 and convert to a hex string."

#: src/reference/state.md:108
msgid ""
"`status` を含めると Pod の再起動などで毎回ハッシュが変わってしまうので、 **"
"「`tazuna.yaml` から見て同じ状態か」** を判定できる粒度に絞っています。"
msgstr ""
"Including `status` would change the hash on every Pod restart, so we narrow "
"it down to the granularity \"is this the same state as expressed by "
"`tazuna.yaml`.\""

#: src/reference/state.md:113
msgid ""
"`tazuna state diff` と `tazuna apply --sync` は、`Build` 結果と既存 State の"
"比較結果を **Diff type** で分類します。"
msgstr ""
"`tazuna state diff` and `tazuna apply --sync` classify the comparison "
"between the `Build` result and existing State by **Diff type**."

