"**1 つだけ** が設定されている必要があります。"
msgstr ""
"(*) Depending on the value of `from`, one of `env` / `static` / `op` is "
"required. For `from: static`, **exactly one** of `static` / `staticSlice` / "
"`staticMap` must be set."

