"docker 側へフォールバックします（意図しない anonymous 化を避けるため）。"
msgstr ""
"Even if you write `oras.auth`, if both fields are empty it is not treated as "
"an override and falls back to the docker side (to avoid unintended "
"anonymization)."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:109
