msgid ""
"`includes` 展開後の全 Manifest を走査し、`tags` を `タグ名 → Manifest 名のリ"
"スト` のマップに集約する。"
msgstr ""
"Walk every Manifest after `includes` expansion and aggregate `tags` into a "
"`tag name → list of Manifest names` map."

